{
  "_comment": "Everything the apple backend derives from a cage's `container.volumes` and `container.tmpfs`. Inputs are curated; expectations are computed by running the real Python with platform.system() patched to Darwin.",
  "tree": {
    "why": "the filesystem every volume/tmpfs case below is resolved against. Paths are relative to the sandbox root; a consumer materializes it in a temporary directory and points HOME at `home/`.",
    "root": "{{ROOT}}",
    "home": "{{ROOT}}/home",
    "dirs": [
      "home",
      "home/work",
      "home/work/sub",
      "home/project",
      "home/project/.claude",
      "home/project/.git",
      "home/project/.git/hooks",
      "home/project/nested",
      "outside",
      "outside/secret",
      "xdg/config",
      "xdg/data",
      "xdg/run"
    ],
    "symlinks": {
      "home/escape": "../outside",
      "home/project/.evil": "../../outside/secret"
    },
    "env": {
      "APPLE_FIXTURE_DIR": "{{ROOT}}/home/work",
      "HOME": "{{ROOT}}/home"
    },
    "unset_env": [
      "APPLE_FIXTURE_UNSET"
    ]
  },
